 卫戍协议小助手 for Mac (Garrison Helper for Mac)

This project is a Swift / macOS rewrite of features from three Windows projects,
all distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- ASP Assistant (https://github.com/Moonfair/ASP_Assistant)
  Upstream copyright notice: Copyright 2026 caihaojun.
  License text retained verbatim in licenses/LICENSE.ASP_Assistant.
- Hongxue Stronghold Companion / 鸿雪·卫戍助手
  (https://github.com/bingyunhe/hongxue-stronghold-companion), a derivative of
  ASP Assistant. NOTICE retained verbatim in licenses/NOTICE.hongxue.
- StrongholdAssistant (https://github.com/LBEILC/StrongholdAssistant), a
  derivative of ASP Assistant · Arknights
  (https://github.com/bingyunhe/asp-assistant-arknights), which includes work
  adapted from Jiayu Ding (CarlosDJY)'s fork
  (https://github.com/CarlosDJY/asp-assistant-arknights).
  NOTICE retained verbatim in licenses/NOTICE.StrongholdAssistant.

No upstream source file is included as is. Recognition, planning and data
handling were rewritten in Swift; files that port upstream logic say so in their
header, and REFERENCES.md maps each ported feature to the upstream file it came
from. Data files taken from the upstream projects are listed in ASSETS.md.

